  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "ん……？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "off",
    "textFrame": "off",
    "bg": "00000",
    "se": "0156",
    "waitType": "time",
    "waitTime": 800
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "うわ！　な、なんだ！？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2004004040010,
    "speaker": "？？？",
    "text": "だ～れだ！",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200400404/2004004040010"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "……えーっと、恋鐘だろ？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2004004040020,
    "speaker": "？？？",
    "text": "そ、そんな簡単に！？\r\nプロデューサーは天才やね！？",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200400404/2004004040020"
  },
  {
    "textFrame": "off",
    "movie": "1040040010"
  },
  {
    "charAnim1": "wait",
    "charLabel": "kogane",
    "charType": "idols",
    "charId": "1040040010",
    "charPosition": {
      "x": 568,
      "y": 640,
      "order": 0
    },
    "bg": "00002",
    "charEffect": {
      "type": "from",
      "alpha": 0,
      "time": 100
    }
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "はは、それじゃ世の中天才だらけだよ……\r\nでも、びっくりしたな",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLabel": "kogane",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "なんでこんな時間に事務所にいるんだ？\r\nもう誰もいないぞ？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2004004040030,
    "speaker": "恋鐘",
    "text": "えへへ……いや～、ちょっと忘れ物したけん\r\n取りに戻ったんよ～",
    "charAnim1": "shy2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "kogane",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200400404/2004004040030"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "恋鐘……、夜にひとりで出歩くなんて危ないだろ\r\n女の子なんだから……",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2004004040040,
    "speaker": "恋鐘",
    "text": "大丈夫！\r\nそう言うと思って、ちゃ～んとタクシーで来たけん！",
    "charAnim1": "anger1",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "kogane",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200400404/2004004040040"
  },
  {
    "id": 2004004040050,
    "speaker": "恋鐘",
    "text": "そんで～、忘れ物のついでに……\r\nはい！　お夜食作ったけん、ど～ぞ",
    "charAnim1": "sad2",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "kogane",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200400404/2004004040050"
  },
  {
    "id": 2004004040060,
    "speaker": "恋鐘",
    "text": "今日はお仕事忙しいって言いよったやろ？\r\n片手ですぐ食べれるように、サンドイッチ作ってきたばい～",
    "charAnim1": "smile2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "kogane",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200400404/2004004040060"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "ええ、いいのか？\r\n……いや、晩飯もまだだったから、すごく助かるよ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2004004040070,
    "speaker": "恋鐘",
    "text": "えへへ……\r\nまあ、本当はこっち渡すのがメインやったんやけど……",
    "charAnim1": "shy1",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_shy",
    "charLabel": "kogane",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200400404/2004004040070"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "ん？　何か言ったか？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2004004040080,
    "speaker": "恋鐘",
    "text": "んふふー、なんでもなか～♪",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "kogane",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200400404/2004004040080"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "いやほんと、腹が減っててさ……\r\n悪いけど……早速もらってもいいか？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2004004040090,
    "speaker": "恋鐘",
    "text": "うん！　よかよ～\r\nふふーん、ぷりっぷりの海老カツサンドと……",
    "charAnim1": "smile3",
    "charAnim2": "face_doya",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "kogane",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200400404/2004004040090"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "ぷりっぷりの海老カツサンドと……",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2004004040100,
    "speaker": "恋鐘",
    "text": "キャビアとウズラの卵サンドと……",
    "charAnim1": "anger2",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "kogane",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200400404/2004004040100"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "き、キャビアと……ウズラの……卵サンドと……",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2004004040110,
    "speaker": "恋鐘",
    "text": "コンビーフとじゃがいものサンド……",
    "charAnim1": "surp2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "kogane",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200400404/2004004040110"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "……ごくり",
    "charLabel": "kogane",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2004004040120,
    "speaker": "恋鐘",
    "text": "んふふ～、食べたかろ～？\r\nうちのサンドイッチは、普通のとは格が違うばい！",
    "charAnim1": "anger1",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "kogane",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200400404/2004004040120"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "恋鐘、もう降参だ、いただくよ！",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2004004040130,
    "speaker": "恋鐘",
    "text": "たんと食べんね～！",
    "charAnim1": "smile1",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "kogane",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200400404/2004004040130"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "おう！　いただきます！",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "ありがとな",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2004004040140,
    "speaker": "恋鐘",
    "text": "そ、そんな急に、くすぐったか……",
    "charAnim2": "face_shy",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_shy",
    "charLabel": "kogane",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200400404/2004004040140"
  },
  {
    "id": 2004004040150,
    "speaker": "恋鐘",
    "text": "うちは……\r\nただ、プロデューサーが食べてくれれば嬉しかよ",
    "charAnim1": "shy1",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "kogane",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200400404/2004004040150"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "……ほうか？　……ふひぎな…………ごくん、\r\nすまん、不思議なことを言うな",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2004004040160,
    "speaker": "恋鐘",
    "text": "ふ、不思議なことなかよ！\r\nそうやって……いっぱい食べてくれると嬉しか",
    "charAnim1": "surp2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "kogane",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200400404/2004004040160"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "はは、だって、すごくうまいよ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2004004040170,
    "speaker": "恋鐘",
    "text": "……うまいって言ってくれたら嬉しか",
    "charAnim1": "shy2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "kogane",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200400404/2004004040170"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "ははは、じゃ俺も嬉しいな\r\n美味いものを美味いって言うだけで、喜んでもらえるんだ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2004004040180,
    "speaker": "恋鐘",
    "text": "な、なんねなんね～\r\n今日はホントに褒めすぎばい？",
    "charAnim1": "surp1",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "kogane",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200400404/2004004040180"
  },
  {
    "id": 2004004040190,
    "speaker": "恋鐘",
    "text": "でも……ありがとね、プロデューサー\r\n机の上にいっぱい皿が並んどって……",
    "charAnim1": "anger2",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "kogane",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200400404/2004004040190"
  },
  {
    "id": 2004004040200,
    "speaker": "恋鐘",
    "text": "誰かと一緒にご飯食べて、そんで美味しかねって言って\r\n……そういうのって幸せやね",
    "charAnim1": "smile2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "kogane",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200400404/2004004040200"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "……うん",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2004004040210,
    "speaker": "恋鐘",
    "text": "……うん、うち、そう言われて育ったと",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "face_close",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "kogane",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200400404/2004004040210"
  },
  {
    "id": 2004004040220,
    "speaker": "恋鐘",
    "text": "うち、そのためにご飯作っとーと\r\n……やけん、美味しいって言うてくれたら、ホントに嬉しか",
    "charAnim2": "face_sad",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "kogane",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200400404/2004004040220"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "恋鐘……",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2004004040230,
    "speaker": "恋鐘",
    "text": "あ、いけん！\r\nなんか、変な空気になっとるね……",
    "charAnim1": "surp1",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "kogane",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200400404/2004004040230"
  },
  {
    "id": 2004004040240,
    "speaker": "恋鐘",
    "text": "うちの最強のサンドイッチがまずくなるたい！\r\nごめん、プロデューサー！　うち、お茶でも──",
    "charAnim1": "anger1",
    "charAnim2": "face_doya",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "kogane",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200400404/2004004040240"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "なあ、恋鐘、せっかくだし一緒に食べないか？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2004004040250,
    "speaker": "恋鐘",
    "text": "──……ふぇ？",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_anger",
    "charLabel": "kogane",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200400404/2004004040250"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "こんな美味しいもの独り占めしてたら\r\n幸せが逃げちゃうなって……",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2004004040260,
    "speaker": "恋鐘",
    "text": "プ、プロデューサー……？",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_anger",
    "charLabel": "kogane",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200400404/2004004040260"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "……んーと、\r\nコンビーフ？　キャビア？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2004004040270,
    "speaker": "恋鐘",
    "text": "……",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp_s",
    "charLabel": "kogane",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200400404/2004004040270"
  },
  {
    "id": 2004004040280,
    "speaker": "恋鐘",
    "text": "……海老がよか",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "kogane",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200400404/2004004040280"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "す、すまん、海老は完売だ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2004004040290,
    "speaker": "恋鐘",
    "text": "ふふっ……\r\nホントにお腹空いてたんやね、プロデューサー",
    "charAnim1": "smile2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "kogane",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200400404/2004004040290"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "いや、ほんとすまん",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2004004040300,
    "speaker": "恋鐘",
    "text": "何言いよっと、プロデューサー！\r\n完食してくれんと、作った意味がなかよ！",
    "charAnim1": "smile3",
    "charAnim2": "face_doya",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "kogane",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200400404/2004004040300"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "そうか……？　じゃあ、遠慮なく食べちゃうぞ？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2004004040310,
    "speaker": "恋鐘",
    "text": "でも、一緒にご飯食べに行くのは、\r\n絶対にリベンジするけんね！",
    "charAnim1": "smile4",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "kogane",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200400404/2004004040310"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "おう！　そうだったな",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "……じゃ、恋鐘。明日は朝からだよな？\r\n俺はまだ帰れないけど、タクシー呼んどくよ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2004004040320,
    "speaker": "恋鐘",
    "text": "あ、うん……もう帰らんといけんね……\r\nプロデューサー、ひとりやと寂しくない？",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "face_sad",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "kogane",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200400404/2004004040320"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "俺は大丈夫だよ、サンドイッチで元気も出たしな",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2004004040330,
    "speaker": "恋鐘",
    "text": "そっか……じゃあ、えっと……\r\nもう、うちのすることはなさそうやね～……",
    "charAnim1": "sad2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "kogane",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200400404/2004004040330"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "恋鐘……？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "うーん……じゃあ、そうだな、\r\nタクシーが来るまで、何か話でもしてくれないか",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2004004040340,
    "speaker": "恋鐘",
    "text": "え……うん！　もっちろんよかよ～！\r\nえっとね～……",
    "charAnim1": "smile3",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "kogane",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200400404/2004004040340"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "ああ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2004004040350,
    "speaker": "恋鐘",
    "text": "そうやね～……えっと、話すこと……話すこと……\r\n……ああー！　思いつかんばい！",
